+# AEMULATOR: emit the body of a union serializer.
+#
+# With a discriminant, one arm is streamed, chosen by a switch on the selector the enclosing struct
+# forwarded. Without one (VkDeviceOrHostAddress{,Const}KHR, whose live arm is stated by the API
+# contract and not by any sibling field), the historical behaviour is kept: stream members[0].
+#
